{
  "_howTo": [
    "This is a template, not an approval. Prefer the helper, which fills the",
    "machine values for you:",
    "  node scripts/approval-manifest-prepare.mjs --out <path outside the repository>",
    "Otherwise copy this file outside the repository, replace every",
    "PENDING/TODO/TBD/REPLACE_ME value, then verify with:",
    "  MINITOK_COMMERCIAL_APPROVAL_MANIFEST=<path to filled copy> npm run release:verify",
    "  npm run commercial:readiness -- --manifest <path to filled copy>",
    "Where each value comes from:",
    "  release.version                 -> package.json version",
    "  release.artifacts.cli.version   -> the same CLI version",
    "  release.artifacts.cli.sha256    -> release-manifest.json, release.artifact.sha256",
    "  release.artifacts.vsix.version  -> extension/package.json version",
    "  release.artifacts.vsix.sha256   -> printed by: npm run package:extension",
    "  approvals.*                     -> the named owner records the decision and",
    "                                     points evidenceRef at the signed record",
    "Unfilled values are rejected on purpose. legal-owner-approval and",
    "privacy-owner-approval were blocked on the review notes inside EULA.md and",
    "POLICY.md; those notes were replaced on 2026-09-13, so both items now need",
    "the recorded owner decision like every other item."
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "release": {
    "package": "@flotic/minitok",
    "version": "PENDING",
    "artifacts": {
      "cli": {
        "version": "PENDING",
        "sha256": "PENDING"
      },
      "vsix": {
        "version": "PENDING",
        "sha256": "PENDING"
      }
    }
  },
